setAdapter
  ├── when the caller does not have the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when protocolId is zero
  │   └── it should revert with AdapterRegistry__NoZeroProtocolId
  └── when the caller has the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
      ├── it should set the adapter
      ├── it should emit an AdapterSet event
      └── when adapter is the zero address
          ├── it should remove the adapter
          └── it should emit an AdapterSet event
